{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plinbo</strong> offers a unique gaming experience that blends strategy and luck, where each run lets you choose different card and challenge combinations in a roguelike style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006010/extras/93886ef9a6ed549cc2189dda9ed9ed22.poster.avif?t=1757973739\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006010/extras/93886ef9a6ed549cc2189dda9ed9ed22.webm?t=1757973739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each turn:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck through strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your experience with your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to reach the target money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006010/extras/6b09a085c63783b4aac2b4fa9c86555a.poster.avif?t=1757973739\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006010/extras/6b09a085c63783b4aac2b4fa9c86555a.webm?t=1757973739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006010/extras/6b09a085c63783b4aac2b4fa9c86555a.mp4?t=1757973739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Strategy and Innovation</strong> <br>With various card and challenge combinations, every run offers a new journey and a different strategic challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tarot cards that uniquely shape your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk, turn-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck cards that instantly change your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards keep you standing in the early game\u2026 others shine in the late stages. Some will always be by your side. <br>Find the best synergy with the right combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006010/extras/3e161ae08afd8de638639052a86f6399.poster.avif?t=1757973739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006010/extras/3e161ae08afd8de638639052a86f6399.webm?t=1757973739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006010/extras/3e161ae08afd8de638639052a86f6399.mp4?t=1757973739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and Enjoyable Atmosphere</strong> <br>The clash of balls, the flying coins, and the activation of cards\u2026 Plinbo offers not only intelligence and strategy but also a visual feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect physics-based ball movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern retro feel with CRT effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying visual and sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your luck and strategy\u2026 <strong>Prove yourself in the world of Plinbo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo of <strong>Plinbo</strong> gives you a first taste of the game\u2019s blend of strategy and luck, in a shorter and more limited format compared to the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included in this demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 Around <strong>15 Buff cards</strong> and a limited selection of other card types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf 15-20<strong>\u00a0Challenge cards</strong>, offering smaller-scale strategic variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>1 playable map</strong> designed specifically for the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Shorter sessions due to reduced round limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Basic settings menu (advanced audio/visual options are reserved for the full release).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not included in this demo (available in the full version):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full set of cards and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps and extended progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Challenge system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed settings (advanced audio, effects, and customization).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete language support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong><br>The demo does not have a fixed playtime \u2014 since each run allows for different card and challenge combinations, you can replay it as many times as you want, with a new experience each time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/